\subsubsection {Problem Statement} The Broedplaats is facing a problem regarding grid connection capacity. Due to grid congestion, it is not possible to grant the building a high-capacity grid connection. It is expected that this needed connection is possible in 5 to 10 years time. Before that, the building will have to use the three separate low-capacity housing grid connections (55 KVA each) on site. Therefore, the building is divided into three compartments, each connected to one of the low-capacity connections: theatre, rented spaces, installations. 
\label{Problem statement}

