\subsubsection{Geometric Initialisation and Data Tracking} The\_initialize\_surfaces method executes the geometric pre-processing required to map thermal loads to specific building orientations. It partitions facade areas into glass and opaque components, calculates cumulative surface areas, and derives base ventilation and fan power requirements. Furthermore, it initializes the structured containers needed for high-resolution hourly data tracking, setting up the lists that the simulation will populate at every time step to record detailed energy balances, indoor temperatures, and operational schedules.
